- `ExternalKubernetes`: registered cluster.', example='Kubernetes', position='Body'),
  containerCidr?: string(name='container_cidr', description='The pod network CIDR block. It must be a valid private CIDR block, specifically the following CIDR blocks and their subnets: 10.0.0.0/8, 172.16-31.0.0/12-16, and 192.168.0.0/16. It cannot overlap with the CIDR blocks used by the VPC or existing Kubernetes clusters in the VPC. This value cannot be modified after the cluster is created.

For more information about cluster network planning, see [ACK managed cluster network planning](https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/86500.html).

> This parameter is required for Flannel clusters.', example='172.20.0.0/16', position='Body'),
  controlPlaneConfig?: {
