  formatDisk?: boolean(name='format_disk', description='**[Deprecated]** Selecting existing nodes during cluster creation is not supported. To add existing nodes to a cluster, create a node pool first and call the [AttachInstancesToNodePool](https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/2667920.html) operation.

