- `false`: disables auto-renewal.

Default value: `false`.', example='true'),
    autoRenewPeriod?: long(name='auto_renew_period', description='The duration of each auto-renewal. Valid values:
- When PeriodUnit is set to Week: 1, 2, and 3.
- When PeriodUnit is set to Month: 1, 2, 3, 6, 12, 24, 36, 48, and 60.

Default value: 1.', example='1'),
    cisEnabled?: boolean(name='cis_enabled', description='**[Deprecated]** Use the `security_hardening_os` parameter instead.', example='null', deprecated='true'),
    compensateWithOnDemand?: boolean(name='compensate_with_on_demand', description='Specifies whether to automatically create pay-as-you-go instances to meet the required number of ECS instances when spot instances cannot be created due to price or inventory issues and `multi_az_policy` is set to `COST_OPTIMIZED`. Valid values:

- `true`: automatically creates pay-as-you-go instances to meet the required number of ECS instances.
- `false`: does not automatically create pay-as-you-go instances.', example='true'),
    cpuOptions?: {
      nestedVirtualization?: string(name='nested_virtualization', description='Specifies whether to enable nested virtualization. Valid values: `disabled`: disables nested virtualization. `enabled`: enables nested virtualization.', example='enabled'),
    }(name='cpu_options', description='The CPU-related configuration options.'),
    dataDisks?: [
      DataDisk
    ](name='data_disks', description='The data cloud disk configuration for nodes in the node pool.'),
    deploymentsetId?: string(name='deploymentset_id', description='The ID of the deployment set. You can use a deployment set to distribute ECS instances created by the node pool across different physical servers to ensure high availability and underlying disaster recovery capabilities. When creating ECS instances in a deployment set, the instances are started in a distributed manner in the specified region based on the predefined deployment policy.


>Notice: After you select a deployment set, the maximum number of nodes in the node pool is limited. By default, a deployment set supports up to 20 × the number of zones nodes. The number of zones is determined by the vSwitches. Proceed with caution and ensure that the quota in the deployment set is sufficient to prevent node scale-out failures.</notice>', example='ds-bp1d19mmbsv3jf6xxxxx'),
    desiredSize?: long(name='desired_size', description='The expected number of nodes in the node pool.

This is the total number of nodes that the node pool should maintain. We recommend that you configure at least two nodes to ensure the normal operation of cluster components. You can scale out or scale in the node pool by adjusting the expected number of nodes.

If you do not need to create nodes, set this parameter to 0 and manually increase the number of nodes later.', example='0'),
    diskInit?: [
      DiskInit
    ](name='disk_init', description='The block device initialization configuration.'),
    enableHighDensityMode?: boolean(name='enable_high_density_mode', description='Specifies whether to enable the high-density cloud disk mode. This mode is supported only when the node pool uses instance types. After this mode is enabled, the total number of system cloud disks and data cloud disks does not exceed the maximum number of high-density cloud disks supported by the instance type.', example='false'),
    imageId?: string(name='image_id', description='The ID of the custom image. By default, the system-provided image is used.', example='aliyun_2_1903_x64_20G_alibase_20200529.vhd'),
    imageType?: string(name='image_type', description='The type of the operating system image. We recommend that you use this field to specify the operating system for nodes. Valid values:

- `AliyunLinux`: Alinux2 image.
- `AliyunLinuxSecurity`: Alinux2 UEFI image.
- `AliyunLinux3`: Alinux3 image.
