- false: does not enable spot instance replenishment.', example='false'),
    spotPriceLimit?: [ 
      {
        instanceType?: string(name='instance_type', description='The spot instance type.', example='ecs.c6.large'),
        priceLimit?: string(name='price_limit', description='The maximum price per instance. <props="china">Unit: CNY/hour.  <props="intl">Unit: USD/hour.', example='0.39'),
      }
    ](name='spot_price_limit', description='The market price range configuration for a single spot instance type.'),
    spotStrategy?: string(name='spot_strategy', description='The spot instance strategy. Valid values:
- NoSpot: pay-as-you-go instance.
- SpotWithPriceLimit: sets the maximum price for spot instances.
- SpotAsPriceGo: uses the system\\\\"s automatic bidding, which follows the actual market price.
For more information, see [Spot instances](https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/165053.html).', example='NoSpot'),
    systemDiskBurstingEnabled?: boolean(name='system_disk_bursting_enabled', description='Specifies whether to enable performance burst for the system disk of the node. Valid values:
- true: yes.
- false: no.
This parameter is supported only when system_disk_category is set to cloud_auto. For more information, see [ESSD AutoPL cloud disks](https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/368372.html).', example='true'),
    systemDiskCategories?: [ string ](name='system_disk_categories', description='The categories of the system disk. If the system disk cannot be created by using a disk category with a higher priority, the system automatically tries the next disk category in the priority list.'),
    systemDiskCategory?: string(name='system_disk_category', description='The system disk category of the node. Valid values:
- cloud_efficiency: ultra disk.
- cloud_ssd: standard SSD.
- cloud_essd: ESSD.
- cloud_auto: ESSD AutoPL cloud disk.
- cloud_essd_entry: ESSD Entry cloud disk.
Default value: cloud_efficiency.', example='cloud_efficiency'),
    systemDiskEncryptAlgorithm?: string(name='system_disk_encrypt_algorithm', description='The encryption algorithm used for the system disk. Valid value: aes-256.', example='aes-256'),
    systemDiskEncrypted?: boolean(name='system_disk_encrypted', description='Specifies whether to encrypt the system disk. Valid values:
- true: encrypts the system disk.
- false: does not encrypt the system disk.', example='false'),
    systemDiskKmsKeyId?: string(name='system_disk_kms_key_id', description='The ID of the KMS key used for the system disk.', example='0e478b7a-4262-4802-b8cb-00d3fb40****'),
    systemDiskPerformanceLevel?: string(name='system_disk_performance_level', description='The performance level of the system cloud disk for nodes. This parameter takes effect only for ESSDs, not standard SSD. The performance level varies based on the disk size. For more information, see [ESSD](https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/122389.html). Valid values:
- PL0: Medium concurrent I/O performance and relatively stable read/write latency.
- PL1: Medium concurrent I/O performance and relatively stable read/write latency.
- PL2: High concurrent I/O performance and stable read/write latency.
- PL3: Ultra-high concurrent I/O performance and highly stable read/write latency.', example='PL1'),
    systemDiskProvisionedIops?: long(name='system_disk_provisioned_iops', description='The provisioned read/write IOPS for the system disk.
