This parameter is required.', example='c905d1364c2dd4b6284a3f41790c4****', position='Path'),
  deleteOptions?: [ 
    {
      deleteMode?: string(name='delete_mode', description='The deletion mode for this type of resource. Valid values:
- `delete`: deletes this type of resource.
- `retain`: retains this type of resource.', example='delete'),
      resourceType?: string(name='resource_type', description='The type of the resource. Valid values:
- `SLB`: the SLB resources created by using Services. By default, these resources are deleted. You can choose to retain them.
- `ALB`: the ALB resources created by the ALB Ingress controller. By default, these resources are retained. You can choose to delete them.
- `SLS_Data`: the SLS projects used for the cluster log feature. By default, these resources are retained. You can choose to delete them.
- `SLS_ControlPlane`: the SLS projects used for the control plane logs of managed clusters. By default, these resources are retained. You can choose to delete them.
- `PrivateZone`: the PrivateZone resources created by ACK Serverless clusters. By default, these resources are retained. You can choose to delete them.', example='SLS_Data'),
    }
  ](name='delete_options', description='The deletion options for the resources associated with the cluster.', shrink='json', position='Query'),
  keepSlb?: boolean(name='keep_slb', description='Specifies whether to retain the Server Load Balancer (SLB) instances created by using Services.
Valid values:
- `true`: retains the created SLB resources.
- `false`: does not retain the created SLB resources.

Default value: `false`.
**[Deprecated]** Use `SLB` in `delete_options` instead.', example='false', deprecated='true', position='Query'),
  retainAllResources?: boolean(name='retain_all_resources', description='Specifies whether to retain all resources. If you set this parameter to `true`, the `retain_resources` parameter is ignored, and all cloud resources created by the cluster that are queried by calling the `DescribeClusterResources` operation are retained. If you set this parameter to `false`, note that the resources that are retained by default in `delete_options` are still retained. To delete these resources, set `delete_mode` to `delete` in `delete_options`.

Valid values:
- `true`: retains all resources, including all cloud resources created by the cluster.
- `false`: does not retain all resources, except for the resources that are retained by default in `delete_options`. For example, ALB resources are still retained even if this parameter is set to `false`.

Default value: `false`.', example='false', position='Query'),
  retainResources?: [ string ](name='retain_resources', description='The list of resources. To retain resources when you delete the cluster, specify the IDs of the corresponding resources.', shrink='json', position='Query'),
}

