> If you do not specify a node pool ID, the node is added to the default node pool.', example='np1c9229d9be2d432c93f77a88fca0****', position='Body'),
  oneTimeToken?: boolean(name='one_time_token', position='Body'),
  options?: string(name='options', description='The access configuration parameters for the node.

