> - The admin, admin-view, and ops roles do not support authorization at the **namespace level**.
> - The admin-view role does not support authorization at the **all-clusters level**.', example='ops'),
      roleType?: string(name='role_type', description='The authorization type. Valid values:

- cluster: cluster level.
